            <ArticleTitle>Starfish heart positioner and harmonic scalpel for redo off-pump coronary bypass.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>177-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a redo off-pump coronary artery bypass operation through a repeat median sternotomy, use of the Starfish Heart Positioner in combination with the Harmonic Scalpel may facilitate dissection of adhesions without hemodynamic impairment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
